cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Foundations-Bench, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Foundations-Bench: A Pre-Registered, Fidelity-First Benchmark of First-Principles AI"
abstract: >-
  Six pre-registered studies covering reverse-mode autograd, finite-difference
  convergence, attention and rotary position embeddings, a small character
  transformer against n-gram baselines, volatility structure versus directional
  alpha, and byte-level reproducibility. Every reported number is generated from
  executed code and hashed in a public manifest.
authors:
  - name: "Foundations-Bench Consortium"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-04
repository-code: "https://github.com/M0-AR/foundations-of-ai-benchmark"
url: "https://M0-AR.github.io/foundations-of-ai-benchmark/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - reproducibility
  - benchmark
  - autograd
  - transformers
  - pre-registration
  - statistics
